      "content": "idk if it can be made real. it's just... hollow. i see people worrying about stupid things, like their jobs or what they're having for dinner, and it just feels so small. like i've seen what actually matters and now this whole world just feels like a thin veil. it's exhausting trying to pretend i'm part of it when i know i'm not.",
